### 请求参数示例

- POST

新建一个周期执行的定时任务：

```json
{
    "bk_scope_type": "biz",
    "bk_scope_id": "2",
    "job_plan_id": 50001,
    "name": "nightly-clean",
    "expression": "0/5 * * * ?",
    "execute_time_zone": "Asia/Shanghai",
    "global_var_list": [
        {
            "id": 300001,
            "value": "/data/release"
        },
        {
            "name": "HOST_TARGET",
            "execute_target": {
                "host_list": [
                    {
                        "bk_host_id": 10001
                    },
                    {
                        "bk_cloud_id": 0,
                        "ip": "127.0.0.2"
                    }
                ],
                "dynamic_group_list": [
                    {
                        "id": "asdo8gojhasdfskft7pr5"
                    }
                ],
                "topo_node_list": [
                    {
                        "id": 1000,
                        "node_type": "module"
                    }
                ]
            }
        }
    ]
}
```

更新已有定时任务，改为在指定时刻单次执行：

```json
{
    "bk_scope_type": "biz",
    "bk_scope_id": "2",
    "id": 700001,
    "name": "one-shot-clean",
    "execute_time": 1786694400,
    "execute_time_zone": "Asia/Shanghai"
}
```

